WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.180
- I had so much fun with all of you today,

00:00:02.180 --> 00:00:04.680
what a great way to go into the weekend.

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.350
And you our virtual
family and friends, VFFs

00:00:09.800 --> 00:00:11.997
thank you so much you guys.

00:00:11.997 --> 00:00:13.770
(audience clapping)

00:00:13.770 --> 00:00:16.960
Listen, I always talk to
everybody after the show,

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:19.650
and so I just wanted to
share a little sentiment

00:00:19.650 --> 00:00:21.580
that we like to tell everyone,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:24.010
which is that I want you to know how much

00:00:24.010 --> 00:00:26.410
it means to me that you're here, okay?

00:00:26.410 --> 00:00:28.750
We are so grateful, for the fact

00:00:28.750 --> 00:00:30.970
that you choose to spend time with us.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:32.690
I know that you could be watching

00:00:32.690 --> 00:00:34.670
or doing a million other things,

00:00:34.670 --> 00:00:38.150
and the fact that you choose
to spend it here with us,

00:00:38.150 --> 00:00:41.440
and really set the stage
for us all coming together

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:44.560
and building this community
from all over the country

00:00:44.560 --> 00:00:47.120
and other countries too sometimes,

00:00:47.120 --> 00:00:49.920
you have no idea how important this is,

00:00:49.920 --> 00:00:51.940
and how much you elevate the show

00:00:51.940 --> 00:00:54.330
with your energy and presence,

00:00:54.330 --> 00:00:56.910
both in that energy and
the way this wall looks,

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:59.730
this wall reminds me of
a photo album every time

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:02.560
and it makes me emotional, so thank you

00:01:02.560 --> 00:01:04.467
because you make this show better.

00:01:04.467 --> 00:01:05.300
(audience clapping)

00:01:05.300 --> 00:01:10.300
And if you wanna be one of
our VFF and come join us,

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:13.480
then visit the drewbarrymoreshow.com
to reserve tickets,

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:15.090
and you can also connect with us

00:01:15.090 --> 00:01:16.903
on Twitter at DrewBarrymoreTV,

00:01:17.770 --> 00:01:21.630
and on Facebook and Instagram
at the drewbarrymoreshow.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:24.482
All right you guys, thank you so much.

00:01:24.482 --> 00:01:25.382
(audience clapping)

00:01:25.382 --> 00:01:27.965
(upbeat music)

